{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7001_p", "source_sha256": "72dd26b940f4af44ed3cc9becd6b1cb995a75f957c403ad02d99d573519c75c3", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n琴葉は『デビル娘と勉強会』というテーマだ）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。\n琴叶的主题是《恶魔少女学习会》）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7002_017kth", "source_sha256": "c5a53387cbe9f559960dfcc1bee90e3caec76968a8d93738de2055e757aaff7a", "ja": "今日は演技プランを考えてきたんです。悪魔らしく、\n勉強できないように誘惑してみようかと思うんです。", "zh": "今天我想好了表演方案。要表现得像恶魔一样，诱惑对方，让对方没法学习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7003_p", "source_sha256": "a8dbfbc2648bc55230403f5e56468190754811b9904410140c3e1f4ef413e922", "ja": "なるほど。琴葉が勉強の邪魔をしにくるのか……。\nどんな撮影になるか楽しみだな。", "zh": "原来如此。琴叶要来妨碍学习啊……  \n真期待会拍出怎样的效果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7004_017kth", "source_sha256": "25d216e5c272f54d260ae8a9951a9a14a25a4e59374e9fd7fa1019d8ae256569", "ja": "でも誘惑の方法がまとまってなくて……。\n美味しいお菓子をあげるとか考えたんですけど。", "zh": "不过，我还没想好该怎么诱惑他……  \n我想过给他好吃的点心之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7005_017kth", "source_sha256": "4dfc4b743869cea452e3a77e355d6dc646e3f6e3479e61de30e7d3273ce5bbf4", "ja": "逆に糖分補給で助けることになりそうで……。\n{$P$}は、何か思いつきますか？", "zh": "反而可能会因为补充糖分，变成在帮它……{$P$}，你想到什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7006_p", "source_sha256": "44ca8d43c3088554a29e81275953d86df9198e41b7243ee7e60a10a696837215", "ja": "そうか。誘惑するのも、なかなか難しそうだな。\n勉強中に抗えない誘惑か、うーん……。", "zh": "这样啊。要诱惑人，看来也没那么容易啊。\n学习的时候让人无法抗拒的诱惑吗，嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7007", "source_sha256": "83bbb091293247ac6a6440c5b1dc67aef1aa8ca4fb14d63014468b643d4b3197", "ja": "休む", "zh": "休息", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7008", "source_sha256": "6cbc3cac32b9bcbae039805745f25f92b6780bf6301165d9f81f38e18789dcfd", "ja": "遊ぶ", "zh": "玩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7200_p", "source_sha256": "2b90a5436b5f25e978d7a07911c324139d9984efc2b3253b24ef23078e2264bb", "ja": "ついつい長めの休憩を取ってしまうことはあるかな。\nすぐ机に戻りたくないというか……。", "zh": "不知不觉就休息了挺久的情况倒是会有。\n比如不太想马上回办公桌前什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7201_017kth", "source_sha256": "cc4f1a14ce30a94d95df70df3f7aaa66edab55175fe8652430c5771b61a22a3f", "ja": "なるほど……。じゃあ、肩をもんでリラックスしたり\n横になって……あ、膝枕とかもいいですね！", "zh": "原来如此……那就揉揉肩放松一下，或者躺下来……啊，膝枕也不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7202_017kth", "source_sha256": "f46df3835d758944099d89c19fa3de12ccea0f7be33131d846f75cbc15632278", "ja": "そのままうっかり、寝ちゃったりしたら……\nふふ、悪魔の誘惑、大成功ですね♪", "zh": "要是一不小心就那样睡着了……呵呵，恶魔的诱惑就大成功了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7300_p", "source_sha256": "2b90a5436b5f25e978d7a07911c324139d9984efc2b3253b24ef23078e2264bb", "ja": "ついつい長めの休憩を取ってしまうことはあるかな。\nすぐ机に戻りたくないというか……。", "zh": "不知不觉就休息了挺久的情况倒是会有。\n比如不太想马上回办公桌前什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7301_017kth", "source_sha256": "83a3882fa1a70458f53524be304555652e60a1ff85c361f83a8d6bc32643751c", "ja": "決めた時間より休んでしまうと罪悪感がありますよね。\nでも、長めの休憩って、どのくらいでしょうか？", "zh": "休息时间超过原定时长，就会有负罪感呢。\n不过，所谓较长的休息，究竟是多久呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7302_017kth", "source_sha256": "0125a0922bd40c53b679b1f06340c0cb3e276cadfb557c694e93462fd0d38d8d", "ja": "何分以上、休んだら長いと感じ始めるんだろう……？\nちょっとストップウォッチ借りてきます！", "zh": "休息超过几分钟，才会开始觉得时间长呢……？\n我去借个秒表来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7500_p", "source_sha256": "415a32497077c2bb0575066702c75ce47aee3e938a37750ac61ea8afe6fb41ec", "ja": "気分転換で友達と話してたら、\n長い時間が過ぎていたなんてこともあると思うんだ。", "zh": "转换心情和朋友聊着天，\n回过神来就过了很长时间，我想也会有这种情况吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7501_017kth", "source_sha256": "81aec39a372905b2e62bfca8df19e5613d4bed0950075bdbb5066fbc3c95cc66", "ja": "お喋り……なるほど。だったら、私とお喋りしたくなる\nように仕向けないとですね。たとえば……", "zh": "聊天……原来如此。那就得想办法让你想和我聊天才行。比如……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7502_017kth", "source_sha256": "681e9e0c86536d60146dc6275ef29673dbb0faa619dff0da19cb6c73dd06b5c1", "ja": "「ノートばかり見てないで、私のこと……\nもっと構ってください」……なんて。どうですか？", "zh": "“别光顾着看笔记，也多陪陪我……”之类的。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7600_p", "source_sha256": "415a32497077c2bb0575066702c75ce47aee3e938a37750ac61ea8afe6fb41ec", "ja": "気分転換で友達と話してたら、\n長い時間が過ぎていたなんてこともあると思うんだ。", "zh": "转换心情和朋友聊着天，\n回过神来就过了很长时间，我想也会有这种情况吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7601_017kth", "source_sha256": "c3d96d6511c550dd2536ce1a0b89a7f4de2be1850996e4a14dc5d788d7eef9b2", "ja": "話しかけることで、気をそらすんですね。\nそれなら、会話が長く続くようにしないと。", "zh": "通过主动搭话来转移注意力，是这个意思吧。那样的话，就得让对话尽可能持续得久一些才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_7602_017kth", "source_sha256": "b095f6bba62ddc64ecc5e4dc26ffeac32ef7e96a17852a1292378d593ec671df", "ja": "できるだけ難しい問題の解き方を丁寧に解説したり……\nあっ。これだと真面目に勉強しちゃってますね！？", "zh": "尽量耐心地讲解难题的解法之类的……\n啊，这样不就变成认真学习了嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
